m=k.rd("Key Terms","\u2022 Gamete: A reproductive cell (sperm or egg) that contains half the genetic material of a normal body cell.\n\u2022 Zygote: The fertilised egg formed by fusion of sperm and egg.\n\u2022 Menarche: The first occurrence of menstruation.\n\u2022 Puberty: The period of physical and hormonal maturation.\n\u2022 Pollination: Transfer of pollen from anther to stigma in plants.\n\u2022 Fertilisation: Fusion of male and female gametes.")
